   "text": {
    "en": "Today is Tuesday. It's always Tuesday. I have lived this exact same day four hundred and twelve times. And yesterday, I finally found out who is doing it. If you're watching this, listen carefully. Because tomorrow, you won't remember any of it. Nobody ever does."
