  {
   "id": "s02",
   "text": {
    "en": "Let me show you. At eight o'clock, the yellow car honks twice at the corner. At eight fifteen, Mrs. Rosa opens her shop and drops her keys. At noon, a girl on a red bike rides through the square, ringing her bell. And at three o'clock, the old clock tower rings. Thirteen times."
   },
