   "id": "s07",
   "text": {
    "en": "I tried to follow. Flash. Porch. Tuesday. On loop number two hundred, I noticed something else. Every day at exactly noon, someone was standing by the fountain, staring up at the clock tower. Someone in a yellow hoodie."
