   "id": "s08",
   "text": {
    "en": "It was Leo. But on the very first Tuesday, at noon, Leo was at home with me. I'm sure of it. So why was he at the fountain now? Every single day. In every single loop. And there was something else. Every loop, he looked a little more tired. Like he was carrying something heavy."
