  {
   "id": "s10b",
   "text": {
    "en": "That night... well, there was no night. There hasn't been a night in more than a year. I just sat on the porch, watching the same clouds, thinking. What if Leo is the one doing this? But he's eight years old. How could an eight-year-old stop time?"
