   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s11",
   "text": {
    "en": "So I went to the one person in town who knows every old story. Mister Gray. He told me the clock tower is older than the town itself. And there's a legend. If someone rings the bell at three o'clock and makes a wish with all their heart, the day they wish on never has to end."
   },
