   "id": "s18",
   "text": {
    "en": "I told Leo: new places are scary. But I'll be there. In every single one of them. He was quiet for a long time. Then he reached into his pocket, and pulled out a small brass gear. A piece of the clock. He had taken it on the very first Tuesday, so the hands could never pass three."
